{"seq":3,"slug":"storage-safety-monitoring","title":"封存安全与监测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/transport-storage/storage-safety-monitoring","wordCount":1372,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"封存安全与监测\">封存安全与监测</h1><p><a href=\"geological-storage\">地质封存</a>论证了「碳能在地下安全待上千年」，但对监管者、投资人和当地居民来说，光有理论不够——他们要的是证据：你怎么知道那两千万吨 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 真的还在地下、没有偷偷漏出来？这就是监测的使命。封存安全不是一句承诺，而是一整套贯穿注入前、注入中、关闭后数十年的「测量—监测—核查」（MMV，Measurement, Monitoring and Verification）体系。没有可信的 MMV，碳信用就无从签发，整个 CCUS 的信誉链就断了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>封存安全管理的逻辑是：先识别可能的泄漏通道，再用多层次手段持续监测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的去向，一旦发现异常立刻干预。监测覆盖三个空间层次——深部储层（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 羽流如何扩散）、中间地层与井筒（有无沿断层或废弃井上窜）、地表与浅层（最终是否泄漏到环境）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[MMV 测量监测核查] --&gt; B[深部储层监测]&#10;  A --&gt; C[井筒/中间层监测]&#10;  A --&gt; D[地表浅层监测]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[时移地震 看羽流扩散]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[井下压力/温度]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[井完整性测井]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[废弃井排查]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[大气/土壤CO2通量]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[卫星/无人机遥感]&#10;  B1 --&gt; E{异常?}&#10;  C1 --&gt; E&#10;  D1 --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[干预: 减压/停注/补井]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[持续监测 数十年]\">flowchart TD\n  A[MMV 测量监测核查] --&gt; B[深部储层监测]\n  A --&gt; C[井筒/中间层监测]\n  A --&gt; D[地表浅层监测]\n  B --&gt; B1[时移地震 看羽流扩散]\n  B --&gt; B2[井下压力/温度]\n  C --&gt; C1[井完整性测井]\n  C --&gt; C2[废弃井排查]\n  D --&gt; D1[大气/土壤CO2通量]\n  D --&gt; D2[卫星/无人机遥感]\n  B1 --&gt; E{异常?}\n  C1 --&gt; E\n  D1 --&gt; E\n  E --&gt;|是| F[干预: 减压/停注/补井]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[持续监测 数十年]</pre><p>下表把主要泄漏风险与对应监测/防控手段对齐：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险源</th>\n<th>机理</th>\n<th>监测手段</th>\n<th>防控</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>盖层破裂</td>\n<td>注入超压压裂盖层</td>\n<td>井下压力监测、微地震</td>\n<td>控制注入压力 &lt;破裂阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>废弃井泄漏</td>\n<td>老井水泥老化形成通道</td>\n<td>井筒完整性测井</td>\n<td>选址排查、封堵老井</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>断层活化</td>\n<td>压力扰动诱发滑移</td>\n<td>微地震台网</td>\n<td>避开活动断层、限压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>诱发地震</td>\n<td>孔隙压力升高触发</td>\n<td>实时地震监测</td>\n<td>注入速率管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"泄漏会从哪里漏\">泄漏会从哪里漏</h2><p>封存失败几乎不会是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 「穿透」完好盖层——致密盖层的渗透性极低，这条路基本走不通。真正的风险在于「捷径」：注入压力过高把盖层压裂出裂缝；附近有废弃的油气井，其几十年前的水泥封堵已经老化，成了直通地表的通道；或者注入扰动了既有断层。这解释了为什么选址阶段的尽职调查如此关键——排查方圆数公里内所有历史钻孔、绘制断层分布，是把风险扼杀在注入之前。这也呼应了<a href=\"geological-storage\">地质封存</a>里「规范选址是安全前提」的论断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时移地震-给地下拍连续片\">时移地震：给地下拍连续片</h2><p>监测深部 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 羽流最有力的工具是时移地震（4D 地震，即在不同时间反复做三维地震勘探）。原理是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取代岩石孔隙里的盐水后，会改变地震波的传播速度和振幅，于是不同年份的地震图像相减，就能「看见」羽流的形状随注入逐年长大、确认它被规规矩矩地扣在盖层之下。Sleipner 项目几十年的时移地震序列，是全球验证封存有效性的经典数据集。近年还发展出重力监测、井下光纤分布式声学传感（DAS）等更经济的补充手段，让长期监测不至于因成本过高而中断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"诱发地震-注入的副作用\">诱发地震：注入的副作用</h2><p>向地下注入流体会升高孔隙压力，可能触发原本处于临界状态的断层滑移，产生人能感知的地震——这在废水回注领域已有前车之鉴，CCUS 必须吸取教训。控制的关键是把注入速率和累积压力管理在安全窗口内，并部署实时微地震台网，一旦监测到异常活动就主动降压或停注。孔隙压力升高与有效应力下降的关系可用有效应力原理描述：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>pore</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma&#x27; = \\sigma - p_{\\text{pore}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pore</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>孔隙压力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>pore</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{pore}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pore</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上升会降低有效应力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，使断层更易滑动。把这条物理写进运行规程，就是「按压力而非按产量」管理注入的依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关闭后责任与长期看护\">关闭后责任与长期看护</h2><p>注入结束、井封堵之后，监测并不立即停止。多数监管框架（如欧盟 CCS 指令、美国 EPA Class VI 规则）要求运营方在关闭后继续监测相当长一段时间（常以数十年计），确认羽流稳定、压力回落、无泄漏迹象，才能把长期责任移交给国家。这套「长期责任转移」机制是封存可融资的前提——没有它，没人敢承担千年尺度的不确定责任。它直接连着碳信用的可信度：一吨被签发为「永久移除」的碳，背后必须有 MMV 数据支撑，否则就是空头支票，这正是<a href=\"../utilization-policy/carbon-market-incentives\">碳市场与激励政策</a>里 CDR 市场质量之争的技术根基。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[注入期 风险最高] --&gt; B[实时压力+微地震+时移地震]&#10;  B --&gt; C[注入结束 封井]&#10;  C --&gt; D[关闭后监测 数十年]&#10;  D --&gt; E{羽流稳定 无泄漏?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[长期责任移交国家]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[修复+延长监测]&#10;  F --&gt; H[碳信用可信度成立]\">graph TD\n  A[注入期 风险最高] --&gt; B[实时压力+微地震+时移地震]\n  B --&gt; C[注入结束 封井]\n  C --&gt; D[关闭后监测 数十年]\n  D --&gt; E{羽流稳定 无泄漏?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[长期责任移交国家]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[修复+延长监测]\n  F --&gt; H[碳信用可信度成立]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>封存安全的关键不是「能否永久」而是「如何证明永久」，靠贯穿注入前中后数十年的 MMV 体系。</li>\n<li>泄漏风险几乎都来自「捷径」——盖层压裂、废弃井通道、断层活化，而非穿透完好盖层，故选址尽调（排查老井与断层）是第一道防线。</li>\n<li>时移（4D）地震是监测深部羽流的主力，Sleipner 的长序列是经典验证；重力、光纤 DAS 等是经济补充。</li>\n<li>诱发地震靠「按压力管理注入」与实时微地震台网防控，有效应力原理是其物理依据。</li>\n<li>关闭后长期监测与「责任转移」机制是封存可融资的前提，也是碳信用「永久移除」可信度的技术根基。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"封存安全与监测","id":"封存安全与监测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"泄漏会从哪里漏","id":"泄漏会从哪里漏"},{"level":2,"text":"时移地震：给地下拍连续片","id":"时移地震-给地下拍连续片"},{"level":2,"text":"诱发地震：注入的副作用","id":"诱发地震-注入的副作用"},{"level":2,"text":"关闭后责任与长期看护","id":"关闭后责任与长期看护"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"地质封存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/transport-storage/geological-storage"},"next":{"title":"CO2 化工与矿化利用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/utilization-policy/co2-utilization"}}